<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- saved from url=(0058)file:///C:/Users/marqu/Downloads/slide_linha_do_tempo.html -->
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Linha do Tempo do Firewall</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    width: 1280px;
    height: 720px;
    background: #f0eeec;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Círculo decorativo canto superior direito */
  .circle-deco {
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px;
    right: -60px;
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* Triângulo decorativo (seta) no canto direito da barra */
  .title-bar {
    position: absolute;
    top: 80px;
    left: 0;
    width: 820px;
    height: 52px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-left: 28px;
  }
  .title-bar::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -36px;
    top: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 52px solid #5a0a1e;
    border-right: 36px solid transparent;
  }

  .title-bar h1 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  /* Logo */
  .logo {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18px;
    left: 22px;
    z-index: 3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
  }
  .logo-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .logo-text span:first-child {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #5a0a1e;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .logo-text span:last-child {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #5a0a1e;
  }

  /* Barra inferior */
  .bottom-bar {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 10px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
  }

  /* Linha do tempo */
  .timeline-container {
    position: absolute;
    top: 155px;
    left: 28px;
    right: 28px;
    bottom: 30px;
  }

  /* Linha central horizontal */
  .timeline-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 90px;
    left: 40px;
    right: 40px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .events {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .event {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 175px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Texto acima (anos ímpares) */
  .event.above .label {
    order: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .event.above .dot { order: 2; }
  .event.above .connector { order: 3; height: 0; }
  .event.above .desc { order: 4; }

  /* Texto abaixo (anos pares) */
  .event.below .label {
    order: 4;
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .event.below .dot { order: 2; }
  .event.below .connector-up { order: 1; }
  .event.below .desc { order: 3; }

  .year {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #5a0a1e;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .event-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #333;
    display: block;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #f0eeec;
    outline: 2px solid #5a0a1e;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .stem {
    width: 3px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Cartão de descrição */
  .desc {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #555;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-width: 160px;
  }

  /* Layout manual por evento */
  .events-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    height: 480px;
  }

  .ev {
    position: absolute;
    width: 170px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Linha horizontal */
  .h-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 248px;
    left: 50px;
    right: 50px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
  }

  .dot-circle {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #f0eeec;
    outline: 2px solid #5a0a1e;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .v-line {
    width: 3px;
    background: #5a0a1e;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-year {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #5a0a1e;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #222;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 4px;
    max-width: 155px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Decorações -->
  <div class="circle-deco"></div>

  <!-- Logo -->
  <div class="logo">
    <svg class="logo-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <path d="M8 6 L20 2 L32 6 L32 20 Q32 32 20 38 Q8 32 8 20 Z" fill="#5a0a1e"></path>
      <path d="M14 14 L20 11 L26 14 L26 22 Q26 28 20 31 Q14 28 14 22 Z" fill="#c0392b"></path>
    </svg>
    <div class="logo-text">
      <span>FACULDADE</span>
      <span>Donaduzzí</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Barra de título -->
  <div class="title-bar">
    <h1>Linha do Tempo do Firewall</h1>
  </div>

  <!-- Timeline -->
  <div class="timeline-container">
    <div class="events-wrapper">

      <!-- Linha horizontal -->
      <div class="h-line"></div>

      <!-- Evento 1: 1988 — ACIMA -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 20px; top: 30px; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="card-year">1988</span>
        <span class="card-title">Packet Filter</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Primeiros filtros de pacotes surgem na DEC e Bell Labs. Analisam IP e porta, sem contexto de sessão.</p>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 100px;"></div>
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evento 2: 1994 — ABAIXO -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 215px; top: 248px; flex-direction: column;">
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 60px;"></div>
        <span class="card-year">1994</span>
        <span class="card-title">Stateful Inspection</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Check Point lança o FireWall-1, primeiro a manter estado das conexões ativas. Marco da indústria.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Evento 3: 2000 — ACIMA -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 415px; top: 60px; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="card-year">2000</span>
        <span class="card-title">Firewall de Aplicação</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Surge o Application Layer Gateway, inspecionando conteúdo HTTP, FTP e SMTP na camada 7.</p>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 70px;"></div>
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evento 4: 2004 — ABAIXO -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 620px; top: 248px; flex-direction: column;">
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 60px;"></div>
        <span class="card-year">2004</span>
        <span class="card-title">UTM — Gestão Unificada</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Unified Threat Management combina firewall, antivírus e IDS em um único appliance.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Evento 5: 2010 — ACIMA -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 820px; top: 40px; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="card-year">2010</span>
        <span class="card-title">NGFW — Next Generation</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Palo Alto Networks populariza o NGFW com DPI, controle por aplicação e identidade de usuário.</p>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 90px;"></div>
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evento 6: 2020 — ABAIXO -->
      <div class="ev" style="left: 1040px; top: 248px; flex-direction: column;">
        <div class="dot-circle"></div>
        <div class="v-line" style="height: 60px;"></div>
        <span class="card-year">Hoje</span>
        <span class="card-title">Cloud &amp; Zero Trust</span>
        <p class="card-desc">Firewalls migram para a nuvem. Zero Trust elimina o conceito de perímetro confiável.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Barra inferior -->
  <div class="bottom-bar"></div>



</body></html>